{"seq":2,"slug":"shap-shapley","title":"SHAP 与 Shapley 值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/explainable-ai-interpretability/feature-attribution/shap-shapley","wordCount":1744,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"shap-与-shapley-值\">SHAP 与 Shapley 值</h1><p>把特征归因这件事，类比成一场公司分红：几名员工合作完成一个项目，赚到的总收益要怎样公平地分给每个人？1953 年诺奖得主 Lloyd Shapley 为合作博弈给出了唯一公平的分法。半个世纪后，2017 年的 SHAP 把这套理论搬到机器学习里——把「特征」当员工，把「预测值相对基线的偏移」当总收益，于是「每个特征贡献了多少」这个含糊的问题，第一次有了带数学保证的唯一答案。这正是 SHAP 区别于 <a href=\"lime-surrogate\">LIME 与局部代理</a> 的根本：后者是好用的启发式，前者是有公理基础的唯一解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SHAP 把一组博弈论概念搬进归因，先厘清它们才能读懂后面的公理与算法。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Shapley 值</strong>：合作博弈里把总收益公平分摊给每名玩家的唯一解，等于该玩家在所有加入顺序上边际贡献的平均。</li>\n<li><strong>特征即玩家</strong>：映射到机器学习，玩家是特征，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是「只用特征子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 时模型的期望输出」，缺失特征用边际分布积分掉。</li>\n<li><strong>基线（baseline）</strong>：预测值与期望输出之差被视为待分摊的「总收益」，即特征贡献之和要精确等于它。</li>\n<li><strong>四条公理</strong>：效率、对称、虚拟、可加——Shapley 值是唯一同时满足它们的归因。</li>\n<li><strong>效率公理</strong>：所有特征贡献之和恰好等于「本次输出减基线」，保证无残差地完整分解，这是 LIME 不保证的。</li>\n<li><strong>算法家族</strong>：精确计算是指数级的，故有 KernelSHAP（通用但慢，本质是带 Shapley 核的 LIME）、TreeSHAP（树模型多项式精确）、DeepSHAP（神经网络高效估计）三类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"shapley-值的博弈论起源\">Shapley 值的博弈论起源</h2><p>Shapley 值要回答的是：在一个有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 名玩家的合作博弈里，给定任意子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 协作能产生的收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，如何把总收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 公平地分摊给每名玩家？它的公式是对所有「玩家加入顺序」求边际贡献的平均：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>∖</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i = \\sum_{S \\subseteq N \\setminus \\{i\\}} \\frac{|S|!\\,(|N|-|S|-1)!}{|N|!}\\left[v(S \\cup \\{i\\}) - v(S)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.943em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">⊆</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∖</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)!</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉是：考虑玩家 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在所有可能排列里依次加入团队，每次加入带来的收益增量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>∪</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S \\cup \\{i\\}) - v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 就是它在那个情境下的贡献，对所有排列取平均即为它应得的份额。映射到机器学习：玩家是特征，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是「只用特征子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 时模型的（期望）输出」，缺失的特征用其边际分布积分掉，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 对这次预测的贡献。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四条公理与唯一性\">四条公理与唯一性</h2><p>SHAP 之所以理论地位特殊，是因为 Shapley 值是<strong>唯一</strong>同时满足以下四条公理的归因方式——这把归因从主观品味变成可证明的属性，呼应 <a href=\"../foundations/evaluating-explanations\">解释的评估</a> 里对公理化的讨论。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公理</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>为何重要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>效率（efficiency）</td>\n<td>所有特征贡献之和 = 预测值减基线</td>\n<td>归因不多不少，完整分摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对称（symmetry）</td>\n<td>两个等价特征获得相同归因</td>\n<td>不偏不倚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚拟（dummy/null）</td>\n<td>不影响预测的特征归因为 0</td>\n<td>不无中生有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可加（additivity）</td>\n<td>模型集成的归因等于各模型归因之和</td>\n<td>对树集成等友好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>效率公理尤其有用：它保证你把所有特征的 SHAP 值加起来，正好等于「模型这次输出」与「平均输出（基线）」之差，于是单次预测可以被精确、完整地拆解，没有残差。这种「加起来等于整体」的性质是 LIME 不保证的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从精确到可计算-shap-的近似家族\">从精确到可计算：SHAP 的近似家族</h2><p>上面的公式要对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个子集求和，特征一多就计算爆炸。SHAP 的工程贡献，是为不同模型给出可计算的近似或精确算法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[要算 Shapley 值] --&gt; B{模型类型}&#10;  B --&gt;|任意黑箱| C[KernelSHAP]&#10;  B --&gt;|树模型| D[TreeSHAP]&#10;  B --&gt;|神经网络| E[DeepSHAP / GradientSHAP]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[加权线性回归近似&lt;br/&gt;本质是带特定核的 LIME]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[利用树结构多项式时间精确]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[借反向传播高效估计]\">flowchart TD\n  A[要算 Shapley 值] --&gt; B{模型类型}\n  B --&gt;|任意黑箱| C[KernelSHAP]\n  B --&gt;|树模型| D[TreeSHAP]\n  B --&gt;|神经网络| E[DeepSHAP / GradientSHAP]\n  C --&gt; C1[加权线性回归近似&lt;br/&gt;本质是带特定核的 LIME]\n  D --&gt; D1[利用树结构多项式时间精确]\n  E --&gt; E1[借反向传播高效估计]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>KernelSHAP</strong>：模型无关，通过一个特殊加权的线性回归来估计 Shapley 值。它揭示了一个深刻联系——当 <a href=\"lime-surrogate\">LIME</a> 的核宽与损失按 Shapley 核选取时，LIME 的解就是 Shapley 值。换句话说 SHAP 给 LIME 补上了公理基础。代价是仍需大量黑箱查询，慢。</li>\n<li><strong>TreeSHAP</strong>：专为决策树及其集成（XGBoost、LightGBM、随机森林）设计，利用树结构在多项式时间内<strong>精确</strong>算出 Shapley 值，是工业表格场景的默认选择，快且准。</li>\n<li><strong>DeepSHAP / GradientSHAP</strong>：面向神经网络，结合 <a href=\"gradient-attribution\">梯度归因</a> 的反向传播思想高效估计，把 SHAP 推广到深度模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"全局解释与可视化\">全局解释与可视化</h2><p>SHAP 的另一大价值是：把许多单样本的局部归因聚合起来，就得到全局视角，优雅地连接了 <a href=\"../foundations/why-interpretability\">全局与局部</a> 两端。常用图表各有所长。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图表</th>\n<th>展示内容</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>力图（force plot）</td>\n<td>单样本各特征如何把预测从基线推向最终值</td>\n<td>单条解释、给用户看</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蜂群图（beeswarm）</td>\n<td>全样本上每个特征的 SHAP 值分布与方向</td>\n<td>全局特征重要度 + 影响方向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖图（dependence）</td>\n<td>某特征取值与其 SHAP 值的关系</td>\n<td>看非线性效应与交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瀑布图（waterfall）</td>\n<td>单样本归因的逐级累加</td>\n<td>审计单条决策</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>蜂群图尤其信息密集：横轴是 SHAP 值、点的颜色编码特征取值，一眼就能看出「高收入普遍把违约概率往下推」这类全局规律及其方向，比单纯的重要度排序多了「往哪个方向影响」的信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"局限与正确使用\">局限与正确使用</h2><p>SHAP 强大但不是银弹，三个常见误区要避开。其一是<strong>计算成本</strong>：KernelSHAP 在高维上极慢，能用 TreeSHAP 就别用 KernelSHAP。其二是<strong>特征相关性</strong>：标准 Shapley 假设特征可独立扰动，当特征高度相关时，「用边际分布填补缺失特征」会制造分布外样本，归因可能误导——这与 <a href=\"../foundations/evaluating-explanations\">解释的评估</a> 里的分布外伪影是同一问题，条件化 SHAP 等变体试图缓解。其三仍是 <a href=\"../foundations/why-interpretability\">可解释性的动机与分类</a> 反复强调的——SHAP 解释的是模型计算，不是世界因果，别把高 SHAP 值读成「改这个就能翻盘」，那是 <a href=\"../practice/counterfactual-explanations\">反事实与示例解释</a> 的领域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SHAP 把合作博弈的 Shapley 值搬到归因：特征是玩家，预测相对基线的偏移是收益，公平分摊。</li>\n<li>Shapley 值是唯一同时满足效率、对称、虚拟、可加四公理的归因，效率公理保证完整无残差地分解。</li>\n<li>精确计算是指数级的，故有 KernelSHAP（通用但慢，本质是带 Shapley 核的 LIME）、TreeSHAP（树模型多项式精确）、DeepSHAP（神经网络高效）三类算法。</li>\n<li>聚合局部归因即得全局，蜂群图/依赖图能同时呈现重要度与影响方向。</li>\n<li>软肋是计算成本与特征相关性下的分布外问题；它说的仍是模型计算而非因果。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SHAP 与 Shapley 值","id":"shap-与-shapley-值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Shapley 值的博弈论起源","id":"shapley-值的博弈论起源"},{"level":2,"text":"四条公理与唯一性","id":"四条公理与唯一性"},{"level":2,"text":"从精确到可计算：SHAP 的近似家族","id":"从精确到可计算-shap-的近似家族"},{"level":2,"text":"全局解释与可视化","id":"全局解释与可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"局限与正确使用","id":"局限与正确使用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"LIME 与局部代理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/explainable-ai-interpretability/feature-attribution/lime-surrogate"},"next":{"title":"梯度归因与显著图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/explainable-ai-interpretability/feature-attribution/gradient-attribution"}}